#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0049 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "No CMSTTPT column at all while CMSTRTPT is populated. Requirements.Variables.All [--STRTPT, --STTPT] gates the rule out -> auditable skip naming the absent variable, instead of one finding per row under absent = all-missing (EC-43). Row 1 WOULD fire were the gate removed. Verdict 2-1': PMDA-SD1103 reports the absence itself."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMSTRTPT type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | BEFORE
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN |
